OL,3,ATributes paid to PCs among seven dead
OL,4,Ain wrong-way crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers killed in a
OL,7,Fwrong-way crash on the A66 near
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough have been remembered as
OL,9,F"brave officers protecting our
OL,10,Fcommunities" in what has been described
OL,11,Fas an "unimaginable loss".
OL,13,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,14,FClough, 38, died when a car driving the
OL,15,Fwrong way struck a Cleveland Police
OL,16,Fvehicle at 03:39 BST on Saturday.
OL,18,FFive people in the Volkswagen Passat -
OL,19,Fsaid to be in their late teens to early
OL,20,F20s - were also killed. They have not
OL,21,Fbeen named.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
