OL,3,AZelensky has 'questions to answer'
OL,4,Aabout corruption in his government,
OL,5,Asacked minister tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe told the BBC a money laundering
OL,8,Finvestigation announced last week
OL,9,Fraised questions about Zelensky's
OL,10,Fawareness of potential corruption in
OL,11,Fhis inner circle.
OL,13,FFedorov also reiterated that "democracy
OL,14,Fshould not be the hostage of Putin" -
OL,15,Fbut stopped short of declaring his own
OL,16,Fpolitical ambitions days after he
OL,17,Fposted a video calling for elections in
OL,18,FUkraine.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
