OL,3,AGirl, 17, killed in Swedish sword
OL,4,Aattack, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwedish Prime Minister Ulf Kristersson
OL,7,Fand opposition leader Magdalena
OL,8,FAndersson visited the school, where
OL,9,Fflower tributes have been laid to
OL,10,Fhonour the victims, on Saturday
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
